          <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">Is the 32-bit name of the general-purpose destination register, encoded in the "Rd" field.</p>
        
      </td></tr></table><table><col class="asyn-l"></col><col class="asyn-r"></col><tr><td>&lt;Wn&gt;</td><td><a id="WnOrWZR__3"></a>
        
          <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">Is the 32-bit name of the first general-purpose source register, encoded in the "Rn" field.</p>
        
